  "description": "<p>Updated version of Boxes At Ref (BARF) mod.</p>\n<p>Original mod link: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1560/boxes-at-ref-barf\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1560/boxes-at-ref-barf</a>\n3.11 version link: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2128/boxes-at-ref-barf-again\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2128/boxes-at-ref-barf-again</a></p>\n<p>Licensing: The original author has been inactive for a very long time and with the mod has MIT License I will maintain this mod for 4.0 until the author returns and take over should they wish to.</p>\n<h2>📂 Installation</h2>\n<h3>Requirements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>SPT 4.0.x</strong></li>\n<li>Server mod only — <em>no BepInEx plugin required</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Steps</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the latest release</li>\n<li>Extract it into your SPT installation</li>\n<li>You should see:</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><code>SPT/user/mods/BoxesAtRef/\n    BoxesAtRef.dll\n    database/\n</code></pre>\n<p>Restart your server and enjoy.</p>\n<h2>⚙️ Configuration</h2>\n<p>Configuration lives here:</p>\n<pre><code>SPT/user/mods/BoxesAtRef/database/itemsToAdd.json\nSPT/user/mods/BoxesAtRef/database/crateContents.json\n</code></pre>\n<p>Editing the items:</p>\n<h3><strong>1) Indivdual item</strong></h3>\n<pre><code>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"_id\": \"crate_unique_id\", // Don't touch\n      \"_tpl\": \"template_id\", // Don't touch\n      \"openID\": \"open_animation_id\", // Don't touch\n      \"price\": 50,\n      \"buyRestrictionMax\": 1,\n      \"loyaltyLevel\": 1\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</code></pre>\n<h3><strong>2) Crate contents</strong></h3>\n<pre><code>{\n  \"66573310a1657263d816a139\": {\n    \"rewardCount\": 3,\n    \"foundInRaid\": true,\n    \"rewardTplPool\": [] // Add MongoIds here\n  }\n}\n</code></pre>\n",
